# Get the Facebook authorization URL that enables product tagging

> Product tagging lives on a different Meta API than the Instagram connection PlugKit already holds, so it needs its own authorization. Open the returned URL in a browser and pick the Facebook Page linked to this Instagram account.



## OpenAPI

